  "content": "# API Gateway Pattern\n\nAn **API Gateway** sits between clients and microservices.\n\n## Key Responsibilities\n- Request routing and load balancing\n- Authentication & rate limiting\n- Response caching and compression\n\n> Think of it as a **single entry point** for all client requests.\n\n### Example: `GET /api/users` → routed to User Service\n\n\n<img id=\"img-1788682497437\" src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" width=\"100%\" />\n\n\nWithout a gateway, clients must know every service address.\n"
}